No edits to `src/workspace/host.ts` (T6a owns it this wave) — the audited deletion list for `WorkspaceHost.execute` is committed as `docs/agents/design/legacy-workspace-execute-deletions.md` for T9. No HTTP turn surface (T9). No `ROUTE_MODEL` change (T4). `ModelCapability.run` stays, because removing it means changing `src/model-route.ts`.

